@baseUrl = http://localhost:8003

### Search OpenAlex + arXiv with dedup enabled
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": { "title": "attention is all you need" },
  "providers": ["openalex", "arxiv"],
  "max_results": 10,
  "per_provider_max": 5,
  "credentials": {
    "openalex": { "mailto": "team@example.org" }
  },
  "dedup": { "enabled": true, "strategy": "auto" }
}

### Search a provider that requires credentials, without supplying them
### (expect per_provider.scopus.errors == ["missing_credentials"], not a request failure)
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": { "text": "machine learning" },
  "providers": ["scopus"]
}
